Implemented step 4.4: Run history + deep inspection UI.

Key changes:

- Newest-first execution history with persisted-run loading.
- Duration-scaled node timeline with statuses and attempts.
- Expandable input, output, and artifact summaries.
- Structured logs, errors, recovery suggestions, attempt failures, and cache/stale reasons.
- “Retry failed” and “Retry + downstream” actions using partial-run scope.
- Added store and component regression coverage.
- Recorded completion in the [implementation plan](D:/@Workspace/@Development/@Scripts/@Python/ScriptToScene-Studio-V2/_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/implementation-plan.md:212).

